{"id":"word:hebrew:H4735","type":"word","title":"מִקְנֶה","subtitle":"H4735 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"something bought , i.e. property , but only live stock ; abstractly, acquisition","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִקְנֶה (H4735) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 76 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִקְנֶה (miqneh) means something bought , i.e. property , but only live stock ; abstractly, acquisition First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 9."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִקְנֶה","transliteration":"miqneh","pronunciation":"mik-neh'","strong":"H4735","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4735","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מִקְנֶ֖ה","מִקְנֵ֣ה","מִקְנֵ֖/הוּ","מִקְנֵי/הֶ֗ם","מִקְנֵי/הֶֽם"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",15],["HNcmsc/Sp3mp",10],["HNcmsc",9],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",6],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",4],["HC/Ncmsa",3],["HTd/Ncmsa",3],["HC/Ncmsc",3],["HC/R/Ncmsc",3],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp2mp",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"something bought , i.e. property , but only live stock ; abstractly, acquisition","usage":"cattle, flock, herd, possession, purchase, substance.","full":"H4735. miqneh מִקְנֶה 76 noun masculine Exod 10:26 cattle ; — absolute ׳מ Gen 46:32 +; construct מִקְנֵה 13:7 +; suffix מִקְנֵהוּ 3:18 +, מִקְנֶיךָ Isa 30:23 (Ges § 93 , 88), etc.; plural suffix (but see Kö ii. 112 f. ) מִקְנַי Exod 17:3 +, מִקְנֵיכֶם Gen 47:16 +, etc.; — 1 cattle in General, including cows, sheep, horses, asses, camels (any or all of them), as purchasable domestic animals, Gen 47:16 (twice in verse); 47:17 (twice in verse); Exod 9:3 + (J), 10:26 (E), Deut 3:19 (not in P), Job 1:3 ; Psa 78:48 ; Jer 9:9 ; 1Chr 5:21 +; so probably וּמִקְנֶה אֹהֶל ישֵׁב Gen 4:20 (J) of nomads, הַבְּהֵמָה מִקְנֵה 47:18 (J). 2 specifically of cows, sheep, and goats in herds and flocks Gen 13:2 (J), 31:9 (E), 31:18 ; 36:7 ; 46:6 ; Num 32:1 (all P), Isa 30:23 +; מ ׳רֹעֵי Gen 46:32 , 34 (J), מ ׳שָׂרֵי 47:6 (P), compare 1Chr 28:1 ; מ ׳רֹקעי Gen 13:7 (twice in verse) (J); distinguished from בְּהֵמָה Num 31:9 (P), 32:26 ; 2Kin 3:17 ; from קנין Josh 14:4 (P) Ezek 38:12-13 , from both Gen 34:23 ; 36:6 (P); ׳מָ ונקר צאן 2Chr 32:29 ׳מ וצאן בקר Eccl 2:7 ׳מ ומ ׳צאן בקר Gen 26:14 ; 47:17 (J); sheep only 29:7 (J) Num 32:16 (E). — הַשָּׂדֶה מִקְנֵה Gen 49:32 (P) read מִקְנַת ; עוֺלֶךְ על אַף מִקְנֶה Job 36:33 read מַקְנֶה ( Hiph`il Participle ), or מְקַנֶּךְ ( Pi`el Participle ) metal. from קנא , Hi Bö Di Du; 1Sam 30:20 del ᵐ5 ׳הַמּ We Dr and others, see especially HPS.","rootNote":"from 7069 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 9","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 9","1Chr 5 21","1Chr 7 21","1Chr 28 1","1Sam 23 5","1Sam 30 20","2Chr 14 14","2Chr 26 10"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":76,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִקְנֵי/הֶ֛ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִקְנֵי/הֶ֗ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִקְנֵי/הֶֽם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִקְנֶה֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 23 5","book":"1Sam","chapter":23,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִקְנֵי/הֶ֔ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 20","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּקְנֶ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 14 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":14,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִקְנֶ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 26 10","book":"2Chr","c